### Get chaos config
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chaos/config
Accept: application/json

###

### Set chaos config
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chaos/config
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "latencyMs": 800,
  "error500Rate": 0.4,
  "corruptedJsonRate": 0.2
}

###

### Probe an API under chaos (repeat a few times)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/boundary/strings/xss-payloads
Accept: application/json

###

### Reset chaos
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chaos/reset
Accept: application/json

###
